{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-60750","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91925","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-60751","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91926","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-91927","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-91928","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-91929","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-91930","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-91931","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-91932","text":" markdown file across all 43 projects — plus each project's own root-level markdown, where TRVM, TRAAVIIS and WRL keep nearly all of theirs — becomes a page whose route "},{"id":"spn-91933","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-91934","text":" its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-91935","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-91936","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-60752","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91937","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-60753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91938","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-91939","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-91940","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-91941","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-91942","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-91943","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-91944","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-60754","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91945","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-91946","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-91947","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-91948","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-91949","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-60755","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91950","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-60756","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91951","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-91952","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-91953","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-91954","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-60757","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60759","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91955","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-91956","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-91957","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-91958","text":" scans the repo (excluding"}]}],"id":"blk-60758","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-60760","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91959","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-91960","text":", "},{"id":"spn-91961","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-91962","text":", "},{"id":"spn-91963","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-91964","text":", "},{"id":"spn-91965","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-91966","text":", and every dot-directory except "},{"id":"spn-91967","marks":["code"],"text":".claude"},{"id":"spn-91968","text":", so gitignored local state like "},{"id":"spn-91969","marks":["code"],"text":".amp/"},{"id":"spn-91970","text":" is never published), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-91971","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-91972","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-91973","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-91974","text":" "},{"id":"spn-91975","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-91976","text":" file, each project's root-level markdown, and the top-level stack docs. 350 docs / 43 projects."}]},{"id":"blk-60761","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91977","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-91978","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-91979","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-91980","text":" parses"}]}],"id":"blk-60762","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-60764","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91981","text":"the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-91982","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-91983","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-91984","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-91985","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes."}]},{"id":"blk-60765","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60767","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91986","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-91987","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-91988","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-91989","text":" links that resolve"}]}],"id":"blk-60766","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-60768","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91990","text":"to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build)."}]},{"id":"blk-60769","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60771","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91991","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-91992","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-91993","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-91994","text":" is checked"}]}],"id":"blk-60770","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-60772","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91995","text":"to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-60773","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91996","text":"The campus "},{"id":"spn-91997","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-91998","text":" Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-91999","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-92000","text":" idea; the pages "},{"id":"spn-92001","marks":["italic"],"text":"are"},{"id":"spn-92002","text":" BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-60774","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92003","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-60775","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92004","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-92005","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-92006","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-60776","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92007","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-60777","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-60778","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92008","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-60779","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 350 real docs mirrored from 43 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 360 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-60780","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92009","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-60781","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60783","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92010","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-92011","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-92012","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-92013","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-92014","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-92015","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-60782","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60784","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92016","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-60785","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60787","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92017","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-92018","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-92019","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-92020","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-92021","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-60786","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60788","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92022","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-92023","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-92024","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-60789","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92025","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-60790","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60792","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92026","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-92027","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-60791","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60794","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92028","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-92029","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-60793","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60796","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92030","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-92031","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-60795","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60798","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92032","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-92033","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-60797","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60800","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92034","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-92035","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-92036","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-92037","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-60799","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60802","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92038","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-92039","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-92040","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-92041","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92042","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-92043","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92044","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-92045","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-60801","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60804","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92046","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-92047","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-92048","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-92049","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-92050","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-92051","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-60803","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieranxjp2tc6ihufzl7gug42wh2wqlxogckkjr345onkr5ijqloifngq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}